Source: vidscribe
Section: video
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Johannes Sood <info@somestrangedays.dev>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/jjjsood/vidscribe
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/jjjsood/vidscribe.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/jjjsood/vidscribe
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: vidscribe
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, yt-dlp, ffmpeg, whisper.cpp, curl
Recommends: libggml0-backend-vulkan
Description: video URL to timed transcript (txt, srt, vtt, json)
 vidscribe downloads audio from any site yt-dlp supports (Instagram,
 YouTube, ...) or reads a local media file, transcribes it with whisper.cpp
 and writes txt, srt, vtt and json with timestamps. The whisper model is
 downloaded on first run to ~/.local/share/vidscribe.
